# tamirs-superpowers — plugin structure

This repo is a **multi-platform agent plugin** (Markdown + JSON + Bash only) for Claude Code, Cursor, and Codex. There is no build step, no `package.json`, no compiled output.

## What lives where

| Path | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `.claude-plugin/plugin.json` | Claude Code manifest |
| `.cursor-plugin/plugin.json` | Cursor manifest |
| `.codex-plugin/plugin.json` | Codex manifest |
| `rules/dev/*.md` | Canonical contributor rules (all platforms) |
| `skills/<domain>/<name>/SKILL.md` | One skill per folder; directory name = slash command |
| `hooks/hooks.json` | Hook event wiring |
| `hooks/*.sh` | Hook scripts (all must pass shellcheck) |
| `hooks/lib/worktree-common.sh` | Shared bash library — do not modify without testing |
| `scripts/` | User-facing scripts (`install.sh`, `update.sh`, `uninstall.sh`, `statusline.sh`) — **no** `.sh` at repo root |
| `.mcp.json` | MCP server stubs (env var placeholders only — no real tokens) |

## Hard constraints

- No `runs-on: [self-hosted]` in any CI workflow — use `ubuntu-latest`
- No secrets or tokens committed — `.mcp.json` uses `${ENV_VAR}` syntax only
- No Wix-internal references anywhere
- No `marketplace.json` in this repo — it is published through `Tamircohen28/plugins`
- Every `SKILL.md` needs valid YAML frontmatter with **all 16 official Claude Code fields** plus `metadata.updated-date` (see `skills/toolkit/skill-creator/references/frontmatter-template.md`)

## Validate after every change

```bash
make validate   # JSON lint + shellcheck + full SKILL.md frontmatter
```
